# The origin the link-preview card is addressed to. `og:url`, `og:image` and
# `twitter:image` in each page's HTML are %VITE_SITE_ORIGIN% + %BASE_URL% + a
# path, because a crawler will not resolve a relative one. This is the site's
# own origin, which the production build and any local build get; netlify.toml
# hands a branch deploy or a deploy preview its own address instead, so a
# preview's card is its own rather than production's. `the link preview` and
# `the front door` in src/guards/meta.test.ts read this file.
VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=https://magnificent-fi.netlify.app
